{"version":1,"key":"card:543","content":{"id":543,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5359e89c-e1e0-4c9a-901d-575094dd6250","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记笔记的建议："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"9586c6c0-d445-456f-8074-a3038f5f44fb","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"d2f66c92-310e-440c-8dde-fdae8e7cb83b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5faafdcf-58fd-43e3-9582-d7bb311f0d49","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录自己的想法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"72164b9d-c30c-4e26-83d1-dbfa856a4427","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么要记录个人想法，现在的公共知识都可以通过搜索引擎或者 AI 问出来，反而是个人想法与思考值得记录。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0574a3e0-1ef9-43ee-80f7-9b066848e13d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录感到触动的时刻："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"c7314ee8-a060-4556-bdcb-4820b649e3ed","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"11b7a1fe-acac-4738-b891-41fb69ed2a8f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d68269ac-181b-4caa-a689-395516b9481e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"灵感很棒，当时看似无用的灵感，能为未来困顿时刻提供帮助，值得记录"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"779470db-2abc-47ac-aa3b-a9ce741a3f30","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8742c3e5-97d2-4498-9afa-711a9f1686fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息有用，如何判断有用，能在短时间内用上，有具体的实战步骤"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"046f6f92-d8b2-4b34-b859-33536bdb9e73","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b45f7fcf-1b79-4941-9e56-768043758f19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"感觉很好，幸福取决于大量连续的小事，通过记录小事，提高幸福水平"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"792a4ce2-452f-4a30-a912-532af0511b2b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6aac7e2d-c819-4be4-9e7f-b2be7b47d794","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录有启发的内容"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4f91b07b-b452-4d4b-9b84-54cd863228a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是有启发的内容，一段精妙绝伦的论述，一个拍案叫绝的观点，让你发出感叹，还能这么做，还能这么想。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"58e04fbe-3f49-4317-a4ef-2ac94b299c71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么需要记录，"},{"type":"content-link","refId":534,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":1320,"collabId":"a5c7340a-6d86-4c8d-8eb5-f7c6eb7ce12d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记笔记需要用自己的话论述"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而用自己的话进行论述，就需要思考，而思考需要信息的碰撞，这些启发式的观点提供的就是高质量的信息"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"b7acf52c-253e-42c7-8744-3028672fb7e5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8ed878b5-59a8-4f57-8418-835269ff6d1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录反直觉的信息"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b9dc6ed7-76d6-4a78-9a13-eb12a99de2cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反直觉的信息可以帮助我们打破思维定式，也能加深对事物本质的理解。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3ccc364e-35cb-43bc-b7ee-60b936566f93","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两个技巧："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"eab016cb-8262-462f-bbe8-af09d9f0c8fd","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"bbbe221f-c3bc-4c77-b6aa-9d42e95d9c26","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2071866b-a32a-4186-98da-87f869fecb6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主动逆向思考"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"fccbf90e-b4ad-42d8-a521-fbbf5e0e1127","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c14da3d0-710c-40e2-8153-2885d9b71f42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持好奇"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e0045c30-52d8-4113-be93-28d17aef8fd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我发现我在学习的时候，也总是会反着想，书里面会讲怎么做会怎么样，而我常常就在想，如果不这么做会怎样，如果反着做会怎样，然后会去实践观察，从而去理解这么做发生的作用，达到更深的理解，知识才能随臂指挥"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2cb95f7b-f23b-4808-9326-a801c8d9a27b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9ce98fac-afc2-4036-bc03-bcdd0314e61e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录让自己情绪波动的事情"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7f82bb72-4410-4501-9695-bc6f1992f6cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录情绪有几个好处："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"812dc488-f0c9-42cd-a136-dcd3244a784b","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"aee9d983-dd5c-4948-8174-041ebb486d64","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"116696ce-7451-4094-af84-999b309d5236","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更好的理解自己，明白自己的性格特点，在什么样的环境下会发生情绪波动，了解自己，调整自己"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"5e507aee-99e8-4272-817b-eadb1cfccd7b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"19e47007-8868-4ce6-8652-e47570773466","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持情绪健康，记录情绪就是在释放情绪"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0093043f-5700-4b29-bd21-cc17869b2c9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录情绪的两个要点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"b4877143-1788-4a84-a180-9dd03dc6e58b","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"54661323-45e8-4691-a1cd-5b4450824007","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1fa51b45-3766-40ea-9841-42f093fb8c78","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"诚实的记录"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"25da032f-5b29-402c-9731-6ee1a1769d44","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4ba2910a-fe67-4da2-8859-a2327e84e797","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7c85570d-53f7-4547-8140-ee38d5ccacd5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录真实的感受，笔记是写给自己看的，不是写给别人看的，不用表演"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"1ed8c96e-e1cb-4323-ab61-9b884dc744ea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"84a32b25-25b5-4d2b-a700-cd1c34226cbc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"深入分析感受出现的原因，有的时候如流水账一样记录，可能记录的不是情绪真实发生的原因，需要追问内心的自己"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"6e968d8c-ce1c-4555-ad3b-317733547928","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2b9714fa-f168-4793-ba05-b086af44ead8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录环境"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"b5ed8e2b-3ad1-488b-a8bd-311a93e7366a","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"d81087e7-3e63-4f87-9e2d-d00fd5862a24","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4f77128c-67f0-4afc-b7b7-1faaeacd3b8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人是环境的反应器，人的情绪大部分是环境的影响"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"1b79d539-8a8c-40eb-a99d-3e8b8690eb1d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ce8e2944-1c4e-4c5b-b685-6eda1c90dbf2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上班时的情绪再怎么调整也不如不上班舒服"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a70342e7-2a69-49fe-996a-a8b960efbc68","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ae5354e9-2507-48c2-8674-cd67d87122dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录自己的实战经验"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"876ea908-36c0-44ee-9514-3aa9a153950e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么要记录自己的实战经验，常遇到的两个问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"7ff54ff0-9b4e-4de8-beb4-2e1700267f4f","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c951da32-36b4-4402-b157-1151fcd8a5fc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"07ccdd74-9b61-4c92-b1f1-e40c96fbaff4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"热爱学习，但进步有限，无法应用知识"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"feab35d1-1c15-4191-9241-a7bb3d1e61d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有实践，纸上谈兵，学习必须要躬身入局，只有实践才知道会遇到什么样的问题，进一步才知道这些知识是怎么来解决这些问题的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c3503af7-e815-4fbc-b981-9d819df39a3a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"23d03ec5-9ede-49a6-bc99-f68661d0626c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"努力工作，但成长有限，无法积累能力"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f31adf1a-8c76-4cde-9ed0-5e456cd29c79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺少复盘，将每天的行动和决策记录下来，而不是就这样随他而去丢掉了，将自己的行为"},{"type":"styled-text","color":"red","collabId":"a3387e85-eb75-4415-936a-488e38645807","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可视化"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，分析自己哪里做的好，哪里做的不好，哪里需要改进，哪里需要保持，经年累月，翻看自己的工作实战日志，你可以看到自己的一点一滴的进步"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8493360e-053e-466e-ab8c-df9c2429a04d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何记录实战经验："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"94e5864d-e693-4930-9710-d1b5930a3607","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"699b1f95-3f28-49c1-ba01-e365244904bc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f9559444-a5ac-4a4c-a00f-93c7a7f7141a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如实记录"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5ddc6daf-a40d-48ce-846e-a569a7756714","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有个认知失调的概念，当两条认知发生矛盾时，人会潜意识的修改其中的一条认知，使得认知自洽，如果我们不如实记录，这样调和认知失调的行为就这么下意识的发生了，我们都感知不到，就使得暴露的问题这么溜过去了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ef0528f6-fa0f-4327-84e6-4952035f995b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"170fb70c-3617-4e74-9f91-7650126ea88a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记录决策的思考过程以及决策导致结果的反思"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6cbac4c3-e3ea-4d5c-9188-6c4ab60934f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"复盘时对的结果进行分析，原因是为什么，不好的下次改进，好的结果继续保持"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7f41f7f0-ff6f-493c-a2f8-7eb4dbca761d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"警惕得到了好的结果，但不是由决策导致的，而是运气原因，这个时候就不要总结什么成功经验了"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"789a9bc5-87de-486c-bd24-ae14f6cf2c58","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f0a87f4e-88ad-4e7a-a613-f000d574239e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"精炼核心内容"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8b2e470e-17a0-4085-af78-15761825f389","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"精炼笔记有什么好处："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"11a4c2e3-4049-4528-8fa5-fd876bc3ec16","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ac548a67-90e9-447b-91aa-870a37ded232","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"505989f1-8ac0-4ca6-97a9-a4368fd7a47f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"检验是否真的理解了，能用更少的话表达出同样的观点，说明理解到位了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"503f3749-7850-4e13-b6ea-b3fe585cb90b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"946edf6c-58ae-4dd4-9f78-1af2a9432d87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"精炼的过程就是思考的过程，思考能带来更深的理解"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"3c62c9cf-0a2f-4e05-863e-2078410d3ead","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"aa3f3652-be45-42f3-a892-7efba956ade2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"精炼观点，一篇笔记可能存在多个观点，主次不分，进行拆分或精炼，保留最核心想表达的内容，方便后续调用"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b914954c-f33d-4a42-868a-6d843d6489fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于记录好的笔记也要反复整理："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"39066d0f-7213-4e4f-a509-0a58560b1f91","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"71847d0d-83c3-405f-ace5-a34b579ac912","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f9be8729-25b4-47bf-a839-59c26de0c354","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复的笔记要删减和精炼"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"e563f490-7937-42a0-b35c-a731c407f679","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"49946038-d1cd-424c-9631-ce60cf6c5016","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同类的笔记要归纳和总结"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"efd2eb01-6ac9-4c27-941f-18567d88bfa5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8ec1afb1-785f-47da-a962-b395c67913be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"梳理笔记之间的联系"}]}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["读书/笔记的方法","学习方法"],"createTime":1743589558843,"updateTime":1792337006060,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792337006060},"links":{"card:534":{"key":"card:534","type":"card","id":534}}}